    rewritten, since they are word-lists and tables, not prose; the two sample
    translations are likewise kept verbatim as quoted matter. The article's
    footnote definitions for [[ ^a ]] and [[ ^b ]] (the English and Greek
    pronunciations of the name) have no field in the schema, so they are not
    reproduced; their content is partly duplicated in the Name section, which
