[[ In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God, and the Word was God. | john-11 ]]
He was in the beginning with God. All things were made by Him; and without Him
was not anything made that was made. In Him was life, and the life was the
light of men. And the light shines in darkness; and the darkness comprehended
it not (ESV translation uses alternate wording: "the darkness has not overcome
it".)

